<%# What a grown-up has asked of you, and what you get for it.

    The child's half of the feature, and the half that makes it work at all: a
    reward nobody told the child about motivates nobody. The wording is the
    parent's own, shown verbatim — „1 час Minecraft през уикенда" is the whole
    point, and paraphrasing it into „награда" would throw the motivation away.

    Earned-and-unused rewards lead, because „ти спечели това" is the news; the
    goals still running follow. %>
<% if rewards.any? || standings.any? %>
  <div class="card">
    <header class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2.5">
      <span class="text-ui font-black"><%= t("goals.child_title") %></span>
      <span class="text-meta font-bold text-muted"><%= t("goals.child_subtitle") %></span>
    </header>

    <section class="flex flex-col gap-4">
      <% rewards.each do |award| %>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 rounded-[12px] border border-reward-400/60 bg-reward-50 px-4 py-3">
          <span class="text-xl" aria-hidden="true">🎁</span>
          <div class="min-w-0 flex-1">
            <div class="text-micro font-black uppercase tracking-[.06em] text-reward-800"><%= t("goals.earned") %></div>
            <div class="text-ui font-black text-reward-800"><%= award.reward %></div>
            <div class="text-caption font-bold text-reward-800"><%= t("family.credit.child_promised", name: award.goal.parent.name_for_children) %></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      <% end %>

      <% standings.each do |standing| %>
        <div>
          <%# Who asked, by what the child calls them („Мама иска"), so a child
              with two parents knows whose promise this is. %>
          <div class="text-caption font-extrabold text-muted"><%= t("family.credit.child_asks", name: standing.goal.parent.name_for_children) %></div>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-2 gap-y-0.5">
            <span class="text-sm font-black"><%= goal_sentence(standing.goal) %></span>
            <span class="text-caption font-bold text-muted"><%= goal_period_sentence(standing.goal) %></span>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-0.5 text-caption font-bold text-muted">🎁 <%= standing.goal.reward %></div>
          <%# A goal set midway has a shorter first period, which asks for its
              share (Goals.target_for) — said, so the smaller number is not a
              puzzle. %>
          <% if standing.period && standing.progress.target != standing.goal.target %>
            <div class="mt-0.5 text-caption font-bold text-primary-700">
              <%= t("goals.first_period.#{standing.goal.period}", target: standing.progress.target, date: l(standing.period.last, format: "%A")) %>
            </div>
          <% end %>
          <div class="mt-2 flex items-center gap-2.5">
            <span class="goal-bar <%= "is-complete" if standing.progress.complete? %>">
              <span style="width: <%= standing.progress.percent %>%"></span>
            </span>
            <span class="shrink-0 text-caption font-black tabular-nums">
              <%= standing.progress.done %>/<%= standing.progress.target %>
            </span>
          </div>
        </div>
      <% end %>
    </section>
  </div>
<% end %>
